MODULE: NoNegativeCountsRetractTwice
TARGET: NoNegativeCounts
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a replacement subtracts a count twice before adding its new member
PERTURBS: ReadOrdinary

--- FIND
    /\ counts' = NextCounts(members, counts, 1)
--- REPLACE
    /\ counts' = [g \in Groups |-> counts[g] - 2]
--- END
